			Label: Use Biome-Specific Modifiers
			Tooltip:
				'''
				OFF: ManyMoreMobsConfig page's blanket Spawn Rate / Max Spawn multipliers apply everywhere.
				ON: each biome below uses its own multipliers instead (1.0 = vanilla biome's baseline).
				'''
